[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20467.708, "timestamp": "05:41:07", "text": "哦，等等。我有個主意。我應該那樣做。  等待。  呃，或者呃，愛。  讓我看看有沒有免費的、無版權的恐怖音樂。好的，我看到有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20490.75, "timestamp": "05:41:30", "text": "音樂"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20494.39, "timestamp": "05:41:34", "text": "。天哪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20509.23, "timestamp": "05:41:49", "text": "我們走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20517.15, "timestamp": "05:41:57", "text": "呃，熔岩極客。堅持，稍等"}]